The CPU-side setup checks out in this tree: PSR `0x80000000` enables dispatch, the MVME PROM setup sets VBR to zero, and the SCC transmit path can produce IPL 3 above MASK 0. The remaining problems are in the detector: it must enter C040 with the CPU line already asserted, and a timeout alone does not prove that the guest continued executing.
